===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|slate}}, {{m|enm|slat}}, {{m|enm|slatte}}, {{m|enm|sclate}}, {{m|enm|sclatte}}, from {{der|en|fro|esclate}}, from {{m|fro|esclat}} ({{cog|fr|éclat}}), from {{der|en|frk|*slaitan|t=to split, break}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*slaitijaną}}, causative of {{m|gem-pro|*slītaną|t=to cut up, split}}. {{doublet|en|éclat}}.

